hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15624","Ismail said: Ayyub informed us, from Abi al-Malih ibn Usamah, from Abi Azzah, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: Indeed Allah, Blessed and Exalted, when He intends to take the soul of a servant in a land, He makes for him therein, or he said: thereby, a need."
